{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "借出的权限",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 150.14,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "其实，Parity 在同一年出过两次事。",
   "spoken": "其实，Parity 在同一年出过两次事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.614
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "2017 年 7 月那次，钱包合约把不认识的调用，用 delegatecall 转给了库合约。",
   "spoken": "2017 年 7 月那次，钱包合约把不认识的掉用，用 delegatecall 转给了库合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.66,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "speechStart": 5.758,
   "speechEnd": 11.448
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "库里的 initWallet 没有保护。攻击者通过钱包调用它，把自己设成了 owner。",
   "spoken": "库里的 initWallet 没有保护。攻击者通过钱包掉用它，把自己设成了 owner。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.504,
   "dur": 7.176,
   "speechStart": 12.602,
   "speechEnd": 18.837
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "约 15.3 万 ETH 被转走，约合 3000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "约 15.3 万 ETH 被转走，约合 3000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.9,
   "dur": 4.512,
   "speechStart": 19.998,
   "speechEnd": 23.557
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "11 月那次不同。被接管的是库合约自己，然后它被销毁了。",
   "spoken": "11 月那次不同。被接管的是库合约自己，然后它被销毁了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.632,
   "dur": 5.832,
   "speechStart": 24.73,
   "speechEnd": 29.644
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "两次的教训相同：实现合约本身，也要初始化或者锁死。",
   "spoken": "两次的教训相同：实现合约本身，也要初始化或者锁死。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 30.684,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 30.782,
   "speechEnd": 35.734
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "这就引出第四种缺陷：任意外部调用，和任意 delegatecall。",
   "spoken": "这就引出第四种缺陷：任意外部掉用，和任意 delegatecall。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 36.784,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 36.882,
   "speechEnd": 41.251
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "一个合约公开了 execute 函数。目标地址和调用数据，全由调用者决定。",
   "spoken": "一个合约公开了 execute 函数。目标地址和掉用数据，全由掉用者决定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 42.308,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 42.406,
   "speechEnd": 48.356
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "假设这个合约，持有受害者对某个代币的授权。",
   "spoken": "假设这个合约，持有受害者对某个代币的授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 49.416,
   "dur": 4.296,
   "speechStart": 49.514,
   "speechEnd": 52.859
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "攻击者不需要受害者的私钥。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不需要受害者的私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 53.932,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 54.03,
   "speechEnd": 55.732
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "他让这个合约去调用代币的 transferFrom，把受害者的币转给自己。",
   "spoken": "他让这个合约去掉用代币的 transferFrom，把受害者的币转给自己。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 56.792,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 56.89,
   "speechEnd": 61.235
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "代币合约看到的调用方，是被授权的合约。额度检查，通过。",
   "spoken": "代币合约看到的掉用方，是被授权的合约。额度检查，通过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 62.292,
   "dur": 6.456,
   "speechStart": 62.39,
   "speechEnd": 67.899
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "如果这里用的是 delegatecall，攻击者的代码，会直接改写这个合约的存储。",
   "spoken": "如果这里用的是 delegatecall，攻击者的代码，会直接改写这个合约的存储。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 68.968,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 69.066,
   "speechEnd": 73.851
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "权限没有被偷，是被借走了。",
   "spoken": "权限没有被偷，是被借走了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 74.924,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 75.022,
   "speechEnd": 77.414
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "第五种，单步所有权转移。",
   "spoken": "第五种，单步所有权转移。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 78.456,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 78.554,
   "speechEnd": 80.946
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "owner 填入新地址，一步就生效。地址输错，权限就永久丢失。",
   "spoken": "owner 填入新地址，一步就生效。地址输错，权限就永久丢失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 82.012,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 82.11,
   "speechEnd": 87.917
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "修复是两步转移。新 owner 必须自己调用 acceptOwnership，证明这个地址真的能用。",
   "spoken": "修复是两步转移。新 owner 必须自己掉用 acceptOwnership，证明这个地址真的能用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 88.976,
   "dur": 7.872,
   "speechStart": 89.074,
   "speechEnd": 96.012
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "第六种，签名鉴权写错。",
   "spoken": "第六种，签名鉴权写错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 97.068,
   "dur": 3.024,
   "speechStart": 97.166,
   "speechEnd": 99.249
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "用签名代替 msg.sender 时，ecrecover 遇到无效签名，会返回零地址。",
   "spoken": "用签名代替 msg.sender 时，ecrecover 遇到无效签名，会返回零地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 100.312,
   "dur": 7.032,
   "speechStart": 100.41,
   "speechEnd": 106.517
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "如果被比较的签名人变量没有设置，它的默认值也是零。两边相等，检查就通过了。",
   "spoken": "如果被比较的签名人变量没有设置，它的默认值也是零。两边相等，检查就通过了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 107.564,
   "dur": 7.344,
   "speechStart": 107.662,
   "speechEnd": 114.076
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "所以比对前，先排除零地址。",
   "spoken": "所以比对前，先排除零地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 115.128,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 115.226,
   "speechEnd": 117.642
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "最后，还有三个容易漏掉的判断。",
   "spoken": "最后，还有三个容易漏掉的判断。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 118.684,
   "dur": 3.528,
   "speechStart": 118.782,
   "speechEnd": 121.365
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "一，代码长度是零，不能证明对方是外部账户。构造函数里发起调用的合约，代码长度也是零。",
   "spoken": "一，代码常度是零，不能证明对方是外部账户。构造函数里发起掉用的合约，代码常度也是零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 122.432,
   "dur": 9.336,
   "speechStart": 122.53,
   "speechEnd": 130.932
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "二，renounceOwnership 之后，owner 权限无法恢复。先确认没有函数还依赖它。",
   "spoken": "二，renounceOwnership 之后，owner 权限无法恢复。先确认没有函数还依赖它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-23.mp3",
   "start": 131.988,
   "dur": 7.56,
   "speechStart": 132.086,
   "speechEnd": 138.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
   "text": "三，Solidity 0.4 时期，构造函数和合约同名。合约一改名，旧构造函数就成了公共函数。",
   "spoken": "三，Solidity 0.4 时期，构造函数和合约同名。合约一改名，旧构造函数就成了公共函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg3-24.mp3",
